# IAM Proxy Italia

The normative text is the IT-Wallet Technical Specifications. Its reStructuredText rules apply only in that repository.

- A metadata change goes in both `iam-proxy-italia-project/conf/` and `Docker-compose/iam-proxy-italia-project/conf/`.
- Implement the specified behavior once. Do not restate it in a second module, and do not change its strength unless the user asks.
- Revocation is the Status List. Do not reintroduce the status assertion.
- Example hostnames stay under `example.org`.
- pyeudiw in the running issuer is the commit pinned in `pyproject.toml`, not the local checkout.
- Do not commit, push, or rebuild the image unless the user asks in this request.
- Change only the requested part.
